"1:20.573">已</span></p></div><div begin="1:21.597" end="1:48.399" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:21.597" end="1:28.576" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.597" end="1:22.201">相处</span><span begin="1:22.201" end="1:22.655">久</span><span begin="1:22.655" end="1:23.126">了就</span><span begin="1:23.126" end="1:23.526">不</span><span begin="1:23.526" end="1:23.743">稀</span><span begin="1:23.743" end="1:24.874">奇</span> <span begin="1:25.236" end="1:26.595">过去全都把它</span><span begin="1:26.595" end="1:26.996">给</span><span begin="1:26.996" end="1:27.214">忘</span><span begin="1:27.214" end="1:28.576">记</span></p><p begin="1:29.012" end="1:34.270" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.012" end="1:29.857">从此再</span><span begin="1:29.857" end="1:30.543">也</span><span begin="1:30.543" end="1:30.928">没有</span><span begin="1:30.928" end="1:31.828">你我</span><span begin="1:31.828" end="1:32.004">的</span><span begin="1:32.004" end="1:32.470">回</span><span begin="1:32.470" end="1:34.270">忆</span></p><p begin="1:35.540" end="1:42.542" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.540" end="1:36.124">也许</span><span begin="1:36.124" end="1:37.003">会有</span><span begin="1:37.003" end="1:37.517">一</span><span begin="1:37.517" end="1:37.757">点</span><span begin="1:37.757" end="1:38.778">痛</span> <span begin="1:39.175" end="1:39.548">让我</span><span begin="1:39.548" end="1:40.124">潇洒</span><span begin="1:40.124" end="1:40.497">的</span><span begin="1:40.497" end="1:40.979">独</span><span begin="1:40.979" end="1:41.274">自</span><span begin="1:41.274" end="1:41.873">离</span><span begin="1:41.873" end="1:42.542">去</span></p><p begin="1:42.552" end="1:48.399" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.552" end="1:43.993">在我写的日子</span><span begin="1:43.993" end="1:44.379">里</span><span begin="1:44.379" end="1:44.654">早</span><span begin="1:44.654" end="1:44.902">已</span><span begin="1:45.274" end="1:46.174">没有</span><span begin="1:46.174" end="1:46.423">了</span><